<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — Dianoga creature port.
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Dianoga` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the
  RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim. Custom body: the
  donor's `Dianoga` BodyDef is NOT vanilla Core — ported as RSW_Dianoga
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml), repointing its 7 tentacle parts and their
  attack-tool group to the ALREADY-PORTED Wave B RSW_SW_LeftTentacle/
  RSW_SW_RightTentacle/RSW_SW_DorsalTentacle/RSW_SWTentacleAttackTool (same
  parts Beldon already reuses) — no new body part needed.

  `leatherDef` stays vanilla Core `Leather_Light`; `specificMeatDef` repoints
  to the already-ported RSW_Crustapod_Meat (Wave B, Acklay). No comps (no egg
  layer). The `pathfinding.framework` MovementExtension (Amphibious) is a
  MayRequire-gated modExtension, left as-is — matches the RSW_Nuna precedent,
  not something to port since the extension only activates if that mod is
  installed. Sounds repoint to the already-absorbed sound wave
  (RSW_Pawn_Dianoga_*, 2026-09-02). texPaths are unchanged text — extracted
  art (7 PNGs: base body + swimming variant + dessicated, 3 directions each
  except the single non-directional dessicated) sits at
  Textures/swanimals/Dianoga/ (extract_bundle.py against the same AssetBundle
  every prior wave used).

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: BiomeCypreJungle (per
  cast_assignment.csv's current row for this species), repointed from the
  bare "Dianoga" entry in cast_assignment.csv / BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml.
-->
